\n\n```typescript\n// __tests__/lib/workspace-config.test.ts\nimport { MODULES } from '@/lib/workspace-config';\nimport type { ModuleConfig } from '@/lib/workspace-config';\n\ndescribe('workspace-config', () => {\n  it('should have unique module IDs', () => {\n    const ids = MODULES.map(m => m.id);\n    const uniqueIds = new Set(ids);\n    expect(uniqueIds.size).toBe(ids.length);\n  });\n\n  it('should have all required fields for each module', () => {\n    MODULES.forEach(module => {\n      expect(module).toHaveProperty('id');\n      expect(module).toHaveProperty('label');\n      expect(module).toHaveProperty('href');\n      expect(module).toHaveProperty('icon');\n      expect(module).toHaveProperty('description');\n    });\n  });\n\n  it('should have valid hrefs', () => {\n    MODULES.forEach(module => {\n      expect(module.href).toMatch(/^\\//);\n    });\n  });\n\n  it('should have callable icon components', () => {\n    MODULES.forEach(module => {\n      expect(typeof module.icon).toBe('function');\n    });\n  });\n\n  it('should maintain expected module count', () => {\n    expect(MODULES).toHaveLength(10);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Priority Test Gaps (Critical)\n\n1. **Socket connection flow** (`use-socket.ts`) — Core to real-time functionality\n2. **Message queueing** (`use-chat.ts`) — Prevents race conditions\n3. **CSRF token caching** (`csrf.ts`) — Security critical\n4. **Error handling** (all hooks) — User experience degradation\n5. **Concurrent operations** — Race conditions in state management\n\n## Integration Test Gaps\n\n- ❌ No E2E tests for Socket.IO ↔ Chat flow\n- ❌ No tests for Socket.IO reconnection with stale tokens\n- ❌ No tests for multi-hook coordination (useSocket + useChat + useExpoStream)\n- ❌ No tests for browser environment (SSR vs CSR)\n\n## Recommended Next Steps\n\n1. Set up testing infrastructure (Jest + React Testing Library)\n2. Start with critical paths: CSRF → Socket → Chat\n3. Add integration tests for multi-hook workflows\